\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 5. Short scripts\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 Seeking feedback\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \'93I\'92m trying to improve how I lead, particularly when things are tense. What is one thing I do that can make it harder for people to work with me or challenge me?\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Pausing before a reactive decision\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \'93I\'92m noticing I have a strong reaction to this. I want to make the decision based on the facts and the likely consequences, not just on how I feel right now. I\'92m going to take a little time and come back to it.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Giving credit\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \'93I want to make sure the contribution is attributed accurately. [Name] did the key work on this part, and I want that recognised.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Repairing harm\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \'93I handled that poorly. I was too abrupt, and I can see how that could have undermined you. That was my responsibility. I\'92ll handle disagreements more constructively next time.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Responding ethically to conflict\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \'93I want to address the issue directly without making it personal. Let\'92s focus on the behaviour, the impact, and what a fair next step looks like.\'94\
For serious bullying, harassment, discrimination, threats, major misconduct, or significant HR/legal concerns, these interpersonal techniques should 
\f1\b not substitute for appropriate formal support or organisational procedures
\f0\b0 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 6. Questions to ask before applying any suggestion\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Use these as a final context check:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \'93What legitimate organisational constraint am I dealing with?\'94
\f0\b0 \

\f1\b \'93Could this action unintentionally expose someone, breach confidentiality, or create retaliation risk?\'94
\f0\b0 \

\f1\b \'93Am I reacting to the person's behaviour, or to what their behaviour makes me feel about myself?\'94
\f0\b0 \

\f1\b \'93Is the consequence proportionate to the behaviour?\'94
\f0\b0 \

\f1\b \'93Would I make the same decision if nobody knew I was responsible for it?\'94
\f0\b0 \

\f1\b \'93Can the other person safely disagree with me?\'94
\f0\b0 \

\f1\b \'93Am I treating empathy as understanding rather than as an obligation to agree?\'94
\f0\b0 \
These are especially useful where there is a power imbalance.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 7. Final reminder\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 LeaderLens scores are 
\f1\b self-reported reflective indicators, not objective personality facts, diagnoses, or population-normed clinical results
\f0\b0 . A 57 does not establish that you manipulate people; an 82 does not prove that you are always humble. The useful interpretation is behavioural: 
\f1\b which tendencies might emerge under certain pressures, what safeguards reduce them, and what evidence do you get from your actual workplace behaviour?
\f0\b0 \
Your profile's most encouraging feature is the combination of 
\f1\b high reported humility and ethical leadership with meaningful empathy
\f0\b0 . Those capacities give you strong foundations for deliberately regulating status sensitivity, strategic influence, impulsive reactions, and conflict-related behaviour.\
Also treat other people's scores, reflections, and feedback as private. Avoid sharing or inferring personal trait profiles about colleagues unless they have clearly chosen to disclose them themselves.\
I can also turn this into a one-page visual leadership development map showing the risks, protective capacities, and four-week plan.\
}